cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use gq, please cite it by its DOI, 10.5281/zenodo.23524719.
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'gq: One Set of Map Styles for QGIS, Report Figures and Web Maps'
version: 0.19.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23524719
abstract: Keeps the map styles of QGIS field projects in one registry, extracted from
  the projects themselves, and translates them into 'tmap' arguments for figures in
  reports and 'MapLibre GL' paint properties for web maps, so a layer keeps the colours
  and line widths QGIS gives it. The QGIS style files ship alongside, for anything
  that draws with QGIS itself. Under active development.
